[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17582.55, "timestamp": "04:53:02", "text": "标签页可以让你在一个很小的屏幕上观看所有视频。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17584.994, "timestamp": "04:53:04", "author": "@OtakuArceus", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/VSZC0x7e02-tCAnte525GcpFOF0YcSpYQWplJkdg1RARvkQA3ETFxFaiYVshpLrqHFKUMz4VmA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "u were too smoll at that time Mink"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17586.31, "timestamp": "04:53:06", "text": "就像现在显示器里的角落一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17588.708, "timestamp": "04:53:08", "text": "它就像一扇小窗户，我拥有这一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17591.788, "timestamp": "04:53:11", "text": "逐一对齐。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17594.31, "timestamp": "04:53:14", "text": "是的。我当时就想，“是啊，这真是太……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17597.59, "timestamp": "04:53:17", "text": "凉爽的。这很好。我想要我爱这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17599.59, "timestamp": "04:53:19", "text": "等等。”然后慢慢地，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17603.35, "timestamp": "04:53:23", "text": "我意识到，你知道，我也意识到了这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17606.07, "timestamp": "04:53:26", "text": "那段时间我还在做直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17609.99, "timestamp": "04:53:29", "text": "Twitch就像一个没有摄像头的直播间，没有这种感觉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17612.868, "timestamp": "04:53:32", "text": "只是个电子游戏而已。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17615.19, "timestamp": "04:53:35", "text": "然后我开始变得自信起来，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17618.788, "timestamp": "04:53:38", "text": "东西。然后我稍微开了会儿摄像头。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17620.342, "timestamp": "04:53:40", "author": "@Minkk102", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TF8h5uIigJBanBg4LA_XZaY69S8H6wHtAUIDSGgMxHUqkEYRKq0z9m5NM8cqeDFnXLN0nN8i8g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ya"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17621.67, "timestamp": "04:53:41", "text": "我仍然感到很不舒服。所以当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17623.75, "timestamp": "04:53:43", "text": "比如，“是的，Fiskam 可能不太适合……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17626.39, "timestamp": "04:53:46", "text": "我。我想尝试一些新的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17630.15, "timestamp": "04:53:50", "text": "然后我尝试了PNG格式，慢慢地，嗯……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17631.67, "timestamp": "04:53:51", "text": "因为虚拟管（Vtubing）这玩意儿，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17633.75, "timestamp": "04:53:53", "text": "比如，“好吧，你知道吗？是时候买了。”"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17635.655, "timestamp": "04:53:55", "author": "@Minkk102", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TF8h5uIigJBanBg4LA_XZaY69S8H6wHtAUIDSGgMxHUqkEYRKq0z9m5NM8cqeDFnXLN0nN8i8g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i was just a baby at that time "}]